    MLflow -->|"persistent storage<br/>5432/TCP"| PlatformDB["PostgreSQL<br/>(platform DB)"]

    %% Integration Points (consumed by MLflow)
    MLflow -->|"LLM proxy<br/>443/TCP"| LLMProviders["LLM Providers<br/>(OpenAI, Anthropic,<br/>Bedrock, Gemini)"]

    %% Integration Points (consuming MLflow)
